  "description": "This ontology will focus on the COVID-19 fields in order to help the hard efforts against the outbreak of the pandemic. It is expected, through the ontology, to understand the medical events or conditions and make medical decisions in more integrated or systematic ways, based on more engineered or calculation methods.\r\nThis ontology will also be involved in the explorations on the Pattern Medicines (PMs) and so called the Generalized Biology Mechanics (GBM), raised by the author in his Biomedical Knowledge Integration (BMKI), a pilot topic full of challenges.  \r\n",
